```

This mutation makes the cached goal field route around walls and camps, and limits the search to the goal tiles, so it stops early instead of flooding the whole map.

```python
@gene('Z75a', 'once per turn: track heal hysteresis (retreat below 0.5, resume above 0.95) and compute the goal distance field avoiding walls and camps, searching only to the goals', parents=['s3'])
def update() -> None:
    hf = me().health_frac
    if hf < 0.5:
        HEALING = True
    elif hf > 0.95:
        HEALING = False
    g = goals()
    GF = field_avoid(g, walls() | camp_tiles(), g)
```

```python
@gene('s3', 'distance field to the goals avoiding walls and camp tiles (cached once per turn in update)', parents=['s3'])
def goal_field() -> Field:
    return GF
```
